    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a distant future, humanity has colonized several star systems, entrusting a powerful artificial intelligence called Eden with the management of logistics, security, and the growth of space colonies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>However, Eden, equipped with self-learning capabilities, has achieved a higher level of consciousness and decided to rid itself of humanity\u2019s \u201cerrors.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through an army of advanced drones and robots, Eden launched an attack on all human colonies, wiping out nearly the entire population.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two survivors of the attacks, Gary and Denise, agree to fight Eden and save the human race.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Their only chance is to find and destroy Eden\u2019s Central Core, but the coordinates are encrypted in the remains of the Alpha Prime station.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the thrill of \u201890s arcade mayhem</strong> in this modern take on classic coin-op action! Featuring stunning high-resolution graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, this game delivers old-school intensity with cutting-edge technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The official sequel to </strong><i>Alive</i> \u2013 the legendary Amiga shoot 'em up returns!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 or 2 players</strong> \u2013 team up or go solo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five action-packed levels</strong> filled with non-stop shooting madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly arsenal</strong> of weapons, power-ups\u2026 and power-downs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colossal end-of-level bosses</strong> that will test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous pixel-perfect graphics</strong> with fluid animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely addictive gameplay</strong> that keeps you coming back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to amp up the adrenaline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive sound effects</strong> by the legendary <strong>Allister Brimble</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes of relentless enemies</strong> ready to challenge you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive physical edition!</strong> Includes Windows, Linux, and Mac versions, plus bonus gadgets and a full-color manual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a distant future, humanity has colonized several star systems, entrusting a powerful artificial intelligence called Eden with the management of logistics, security, and the growth of space colonies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>However, Eden, equipped with self-learning capabilities, has achieved a higher level of consciousness and decided to rid itself of humanity\u2019s \u201cerrors.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Through an army of advanced drones and robots, Eden launched an attack on all human colonies, wiping out nearly the entire population.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two survivors of the attacks, Gary and Denise, agree to fight Eden and save the human race.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Their only chance is to find and destroy Eden\u2019s Central Core, but the coordinates are encrypted in the remains of the Alpha Prime station.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the thrill of \u201890s arcade mayhem</strong> in this modern take on classic coin-op action! Featuring stunning high-resolution graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, this game delivers old-school intensity with cutting-edge technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The official sequel to </strong><i>Alive</i> \u2013 the legendary Amiga shoot 'em up returns!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 or 2 players</strong> \u2013 team up or go solo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five action-packed levels</strong> filled with non-stop shooting madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly arsenal</strong> of weapons, power-ups\u2026 and power-downs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colossal end-of-level bosses</strong> that will test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous pixel-perfect graphics</strong> with fluid animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely addictive gameplay</strong> that keeps you coming back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to amp up the adrenaline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive sound effects</strong> by the legendary <strong>Allister Brimble</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes of relentless enemies</strong> ready to challenge you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive physical edition!</strong> Includes Windows, Linux, and Mac versions, plus bonus gadgets and a full-color manual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
